            <profile id="6865-b6ae-11f7-432c" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="aab0-aa1e-0319-4ffe" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Bow and hand weapon. May have light armour (+2 pts), shield (+1 pt), thrusting spear (+1 pt). Light Cavalry. Despite the name, Turcopoles are not Turkish cavalry. (Armies of Antiquity p.41)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
